Package: mcp-server-invokeai
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends},
 python3-mcp (>= 1:2.0.0),
 python3-fastmcp (>= 4.0.0~b3),
 python3-pydantic (>= 2),
 python3-httpx (>= 0.24.0),
Provides: invokeai-mcp-server, python3-invokeai-mcp-server
Description: MCP server for InvokeAI image generation
 Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that lets AI agents such as Claude
 Desktop and Claude Code generate images through a running InvokeAI
 instance: text-to-image, img2img, upscaling, model listing and queue
 status. Talks to InvokeAI over its REST API (default 127.0.0.1:9090).

Package: mcprack-mcp-server-invokeai
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 mcprack (>= 1.5.4),
 mcp-server-invokeai (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: Registers InvokeAI MCP server into mcprack catalog
 Companion package for mcp-server-invokeai. Installing it registers
 the mcp-server-invokeai binary as an available MCP server in the local
 mcprack instance; removing it unregisters it again.
